    "display_title": "feat(native): tick_phases counts=1, each pass's changed slots against the living (spec 39 step 8c-xxii)",
    "event": "pull_request",
    "head_branch": "feature/tick-phase-counts-in-the-crate",
    "head_commit_message": "feat(native): tick_phases counts=1, each pass's changed slots against the living (spec 39 step 8c-xxii)\n\nbreach_tick_phases takes counts=1: after the times, each pass of the tick\nin its order, the unit store's slots it changed and the living as it\nbegan, a lap, and the share changed (spec 38 step 2's measure for Q24).\n\nlaps::lap now takes the field and shows it to a watcher while\nlaps::watched runs, its time left out of the next lap. phases::counts\ncopies the store's columns at each lap and compares every column of\neach slot. The bin counts the untimed twin, so timed runs don't change,\nand the twin must still end where the timed battle does.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011AyPi5Gin9en78UVDebW4w",
    "head_sha": "93e3adf1105281cc392e36bec378e4e42eaf7054",
